---
interface Props { lang?: 'de' | 'en'; }
const { lang = 'de' } = Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === 'en';
---
<section class="section about" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-wrapper">
      <div class="about-content">
        <span class="section-label">{isEn ? 'Who\'s behind it' : 'Wer dahinter steht'}</span>
        <h2>{isEn ? 'Using AI responsibly.' : 'KI verantwortungsvoll einsetzen.'}</h2>
        <p class="about-desc">
          {isEn ? <Fragment>AUSTR.AI is a project by <a href="https://www.flb.co.at" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Florian Bieche</a>, a communications consultant and AI enabler based in Vienna. In my daily work, I support organisations that want to use artificial intelligence meaningfully and in compliance with applicable data protection standards.</Fragment> : <Fragment>AUSTR.AI ist ein Projekt von <a href="https://www.flb.co.at" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Florian Bieche</a>, Kommunikationsberater und KI-Enabler aus Wien. In meiner täglichen Arbeit begleite ich Organisationen, die künstliche Intelligenz sinnvoll und im Einklang mit geltenden Datenschutzanforderungen einsetzen möchten.</Fragment>}
        </p>
        <p class="about-desc">
          {isEn ? 'The tool emerged directly from this consulting work. Again and again, companies wanted to benefit from modern AI models but were hesitant to hand sensitive data over to external providers. AUSTR.AI is the practical answer to that dilemma: a local AI assistant that protects your data automatically, without forcing you to change the way you work.' : 'Das Werkzeug ist direkt aus dieser Beratungsarbeit entstanden. Immer wieder wollten Unternehmen von modernen KI-Modellen profitieren, zögerten aber, sensible Daten an externe Anbieter weiterzugeben. AUSTR.AI ist die praktische Antwort auf dieses Dilemma: ein lokaler KI-Assistent, der deine Daten automatisch schützt, ohne dass du deine gewohnte Arbeitsweise aufgeben musst.'}
        </p>
        <div class="about-services">
          <h4>{isEn ? 'Beyond AUSTR.AI:' : 'Neben AUSTR.AI:'}</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
              <span>{isEn ? 'AI consulting for businesses' : 'KI-Beratung für Unternehmen'}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
              <span>{isEn ? 'Custom AI solution development' : 'Entwicklung maßgeschneiderter KI-Lösungen'}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
              <span>{isEn ? 'Workshops & training on AI applications' : 'Workshops & Trainings zu KI-Anwendungen'}</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="about-actions">
          <a href="https://www.flb.co.at" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            {isEn ? 'Learn more at FLB.CO.AT' : 'Mehr erfahren auf FLB.CO.AT'}
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17l9.2-9.2M17 17V8H8"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-card">
        <div class="about-card-inner">
          <div class="about-avatar">FB</div>
          <div class="about-meta">
            <strong>Florian Bieche</strong>
            <span>{isEn ? 'Communications Consultant & AI Enabler' : 'Kommunikationsberater & KI-Enabler'}</span>
            <span class="about-location">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0118 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
              {isEn ? 'Vienna, Austria' : 'Wien, Österreich'}
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="about-card-divider"></div>
          <div class="about-brand">
            <a href="https://www.flb.co.at" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="about-brand-link">
              <strong>FLB.CO.AT</strong>
              <span>{isEn ? 'Communications & AI Consulting' : 'Kommunikation & KI-Beratung'}</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    position: relative;
  }

  .about::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--color-border), transparent);
  }

  .about-wrapper {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 0.7fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-desc {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-desc a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.4);
    transition: text-decoration-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .about-desc a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .about-services {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .about-services h4 {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-services ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .about-services li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .about-services li svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .about-actions {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .about-card {
    position: sticky;
    top: 6rem;
  }

  .about-card-inner {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-base);
  }

  .about-card-inner:hover {
    border-color: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.3);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
  }

  .about-avatar {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-accent-dark), var(--color-accent-purple));
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: white;
    margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .about-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .about-meta strong {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .about-meta span {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .about-location {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dim) !important;
  }

  .about-card-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .about-brand-link {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    transition: background var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .about-brand-link:hover {
    background: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.06);
  }

  .about-brand-link strong {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .about-brand-link span {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-wrapper {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .about-card {
      position: static;
      max-width: 360px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>